OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 10 NOV
OL,4,CEVENTS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG2021FAdam Boulton announces he is to
OL,7,Fleave Sky News at the end of the year.
OL,8,
OL,9,FBoulton joined the news channel as
OL,10,Fpolitical editor at its launch in 1989
OL,11,Fand served as editor-at-large since
OL,12,F2014.
OL,13,
OL,14,FHe told The Times his departure was a
OL,15,F"mutual decision" as the channel
OL,16,Fdevelops for "the next generation".
